1
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:07,400
迈克:哈!是他们让你穿这身衣服上船的吗?
Mike: Ha!That's what they make you wear at Captain Sub?

2
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:10,400
卢克:不,我只是喜欢穿戴得像条白鱼.
Luke: No, I just like to dress like Popeye.

3
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,900
迈克:我说,你刚开始工作,要知道有些人是很难对付的.
Mike: Look, when you get a new job, you do have to deal with difficult people.

4
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:16,280
卢克:你说的是顾客吗?
Luke: You mean like the customers?

5
00:00:16,680 --> 00:00:18,080
迈克:不,你的家人.
Mike: No, like your family.

6
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:20,760
麦琪:哦,噢,水手们!
Maggie: Ahoy, matey!

7
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:24,700
杰森:准许登船!
Jason: Permission a board!

8
00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:28,220
麦琪:再照一张,我要寄给在伦敦的开萝尔…
Maggie: Let me take one more to send to Carol in London...

9
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:30,720
迈克:好主意,妈妈.
Mike: That's a great idea, Mom, then we can put a different address on it,

10
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:32,740
我们在信封上换个地址写上,让她觉得我们搬家了.
and make her think we moved.

11
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:35,720
本:非常感谢,
Ben: Thanks a lot, Captain Crunch.

12
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:37,720
穷光蛋船长.爸爸一大早就用招聘启事把我叫醒.
Dad woke me up this morning with the want ads.

13
00:00:38,180 --> 00:00:39,600
你找个工作上为了什么啊?
What do you need a job for anyway?

14
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:42,460
麦琪:哦,我知道.他是为了存钱上大学.
Maggie: Oh, I bet I know.He's saving for college.

15
00:00:42,580 --> 00:00:43,500
卢克:但首先,要买头哈利猪.
Luke: But first, a custom Harley.

16
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:45,500
杰森:你攒钱为了买一头猪?
Jason: You're saving up to buy a Hog?

17
00:00:46,720 --> 00:00:50,000
克莉丝:他想买猪?你连一只猫都不给我买.
Chrissy: He gets a Hog?You won't even let me get a kitten.

18
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:53,020
本:嘿,卢克,包里是什么?
Ben: Hey, Luke.What's in the bag?

19
00:00:53,900 --> 00:00:56,220
卢克:只是我领的水手帽.
Luke: It's just my official Captain Sub hat.

20
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:59,980
麦琪:哦,戴上.我想拍张穿整套制服的相片.
Maggie: Well put in on.I want to take a picture of the entire uniform.

21
00:01:00,580 --> 00:01:01,380
本:不,真的.
Ben: No, really.

22
00:01:01,840 --> 00:01:03,880
麦琪:来吧,他们说制服让你像个男人.
Maggie: Come on, they say the uniform makes the man.

23
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:10,380
本:还不如说,制服让人像个三明治.
Ben: In this case the uniform makes the sandwich.

24
00:01:12,080 --> 00:01:13,900
卢克:哦,我得走了.我老板开车来接我.
Luke: Well, I'd better get going.My boss is driving me to work.

25
00:01:13,900 --> 00:01:16,800
杰森:你老板接你上班?我也想找个这样的工作.
Jason: Your boss drives you to work?I'd like to get a job like that.

26
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,300
卢克:哦,他们在找一个财会人员,如果你有兴趣的话.
Luke: Well, they're looking for a counter person if you're available.

27
00:01:20,780 --> 00:01:22,320
杰森:本,听见了吗?本!本!
Jason: Ben, you hear that?Ben!Ben!

28
00:01:24,160 --> 00:01:25,580
杰森:嘿,给你提个小建议,
Jason: Hey, I got a tip for you Luke.

29
00:01:25,580 --> 00:01:29,140
卢克.你可以利用这次坐车的机会,好好地了解你的老板.
You take advantage of this car-pooling opportunity to get to know your boss.

30
00:01:29,640 --> 00:01:31,180
他也许可以教你点什么.
He probably could teach you a thing or two.

31
00:01:40,920 --> 00:01:44,000
杰森:退后!退后!大家别动.我来应付他.
Jason: Stay back!Stay back!Hold it here everybody.I can handle this.

32
00:01:44,480 --> 00:01:47,560
卢克:不,不,不,西沃医生.这是凯文,我的老板.
Luke: No, no, no, Dr.Seaver.This is Kevin, my boss.

33
00:01:47,900 --> 00:01:50,480
凯文:嘿,卢克!准备好去"跳摇滚"了吗?
Kevin: Hey, Luke!Ready to rock'n roll?

34
00:03:00,040 --> 00:03:00,100
迈克:你工作第一周感觉如何?
Mike: So how was your first week at work?

35
00:03:00,100 --> 00:03:07,800
卢克:哦,你面前的是一位新上任的…经理助理.
Luke: Well, you're now looking at the new...assistant manager.

36
00:03:10,140 --> 00:03:11,180
迈克:又换了一顶傻瓜帽,呃?
Mike: Another dumb hat, huh?

37
00:03:11,580 --> 00:03:14,220
卢克:你应该去看厕所管理员戴的那顶帽子.
Luke: You should see the hat the restroom supervisor has to wear.

38
00:03:15,860 --> 00:03:17,900
麦琪:嘿,卢克.很高兴遇到你.我们发现你总是很晚才回来.
Maggie: Hey, Luke.Glad we caught you.We've noticed you've been keeping late hours.

39
00:03:17,900 --> 00:03:19,800
卢克:哦,我工作到9点半呢.
Luke: Well, I work 'til 9:30.

40
00:03:22,260 --> 00:03:23,440
杰森:是的,不过你总是11点以后才回来.
Jason: Yeah, but you've been getting home after 11:00.

41
00:03:23,440 --> 00:03:25,700
卢克:哦,哦,凯文喜欢下班后去放松放松.
Luke: Well, well, Kevin thinks it's a good idea to unwind after work.

42
00:03:28,480 --> 00:03:31,240
杰森:噢,你听那个家伙的.
Jason: Ooooh, you listen to a guy who's only working at Captain Sub until

43
00:03:31,240 --> 00:03:33,200
也许他只是在船上工作到晚上,然后下船去干他的犯罪勾当.
he can get his criminal career off the ground?

44
00:03:35,080 --> 00:03:37,400
麦琪:哦,你可以让凯文先把你送回家.
Maggie: Well, you could ask Kevin to drop you off at home,

45
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:39,400
然后,他爱上哪里放松就上哪里.
and then he can go unwind wherever he wants.

46
00:03:39,920 --> 00:03:42,020
卢克:我可以…不,我不想这样.
Luke: I could...but, I don't want to.

47
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:47,140
麦琪:哦,那么,卢克,我们也许应该谈谈,给你实行宵禁了.
Maggie: Well, then, Luke.We maybe should talk about you having a curfew.

48
00:03:48,040 --> 00:03:48,200
迈克:这是错误的.
Mike: Big mistake.

49
00:03:48,200 --> 00:03:49,900
杰森:卢克,请你出去一下,好吗?
Jason: Luke, will you excuse us for a minute?

50
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:54,240
卢克:替我说句好话,我请你吃三明治.
Luke: Stick up for me, and I'll slip you a hoagie.

51
00:03:55,960 --> 00:03:57,640
杰森:我希望在卢克面前,你不要跟我们意见相反.
Jason: I wish you wouldn't contradict us in front of Luke.

52
00:03:57,640 --> 00:04:00,000
迈克:爸爸,对不起.我不是有意的.只是,你们非得搞什么宵禁,这纯粹是自找麻烦.
Mike: Dad, I'm sorry, I didn't mean to.It's just that you were really cruising for trouble with that whole curfew thing.

53
00:04:02,320 --> 00:04:02,920
杰森:哦,是吗?
Jason: Oh, we are?

54
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:08,740
迈克:是的,爸爸,卢克跟别人不一样.我是说…直说吧,
Mike: Yeah, Dad, Luke is a different breed of horse.I mean...let's face it.

55
00:04:08,980 --> 00:04:14,260
你们对待开萝尔就像耕地的马;克莉丝是匹小马;本…哦,
You're used to Carol, who pulls the plough, and Chrissy, who's still a pony,

56
00:04:14,380 --> 00:04:17,760
他是马的屁股.
and Ben...well, he's pretty much a horse's patoot.

57
00:04:20,080 --> 00:04:21,200
迈克:但是,卢克就像我;他是一匹野马.
Mike: But Luke is like me; he's a wild mustang.

58
00:04:21,200 --> 00:04:23,100
麦琪:哦,谢谢你,野马.
Maggie: Well, thank you Gabbie.

59
00:04:23,100 --> 00:04:27,500
迈克:听我说…我觉得,如果你们想用栅栏把卢克围起来,他会一脚踢开的.
Mike: Look...my point is, is that you try to put a fence around Luke, he's just going to kick it over.

60
00:04:29,840 --> 00:04:29,900
麦琪:迈克,要是用栅栏圈住你…
Maggie: Mike, where are you going with all this horse....

61
00:04:29,900 --> 00:04:31,200
杰森:麦琪…
Jason: Maggie...

62
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:34,100
麦琪:…类推一下.
Maggie: ...analogy.

63
00:04:34,860 --> 00:04:36,100
迈克:别实行宵禁.等他困了,
Mike: Don't give him a curfew,

64
00:04:36,160 --> 00:04:37,200
他会老老实实地回到马棚的.
and he'll mosey on back to the barn as soon as he's sleepy.

65
00:04:39,420 --> 00:04:42,720
麦琪:需要我提醒你吗?我们成功地抚养了4个孩子,
Maggie: Need I remind you that we have successfully raised four children,

66
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:43,880
而且你也有过宵禁?
and you had a curfew?

67
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:47,740
迈克:不,你们有过而已.我能打开窗户,还有梯子.
Mike: No, you had a curfew.I had an open window and a trellis.

68
00:04:49,780 --> 00:04:52,060
杰森:迈克,我们要管好这个家,
Jason: Mike, we've got to run this house by our rules.

69
00:04:52,220 --> 00:04:53,580
必须有规矩.
Luke is a foster child here,

70
00:04:53,580 --> 00:04:55,360
卢克是个收养的孩子,我看没有理由不对他实行宵禁.
and I see no reason why he shouldn't have a curfew.

71
00:04:55,860 --> 00:04:57,000
迈克:好吧,行,
Mike: Okay, all right, fine.

72
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:58,900
好.你们可以把旗杆竖起来,可我认为他不会坐上去的.
You can run it up the flagpole, but I don't think he'll sit on it.

73
00:04:58,900 --> 00:05:02,200
杰森:卢克!
Jason: Luke!

74
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:07,700
麦琪:好吧,卢克,我们要求你工作日在10点回家,周末在11点回家.
Maggie: Okay, Luke, we want you in the house 10:00 on weekdays and 11:00 on weekends

75
00:05:07,700 --> 00:05:12,200
卢克:好的.
Luke: Okay.

76
00:05:14,900 --> 00:05:18,020
杰森:哦,你知道吗,这都是老顽固父母定下的规矩.
Jason: Well, what do you know; the wacky old parents pulled it off.

77
00:05:18,640 --> 00:05:20,320
迈克:是的,埃德外公总出坏主意.
Mike: Yeah, and Mr.Ed really talks.

78
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:25,000
本:克莉丝…猜一猜形状.
Ben: Now, Chrissy...name the shape.

79
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:27,400
克莉丝:方的!
Chrissy: Square!

80
00:05:27,400 --> 00:05:31,100
本:不对.抓紧时间,比方的要圆.
Ben: No, take your time, think rounder.

81
00:05:31,100 --> 00:05:33,200
克莉丝:方的!
Chrissy: Square!

82
00:05:35,480 --> 00:05:38,580
本:想一想,就像…馅饼…或者月亮.
Ben: Think like, think like....a pie...or the moon.

83
00:05:39,460 --> 00:05:40,180
克莉丝:月亮馅饼?
Chrissy: Moon pie?

84
00:05:42,500 --> 00:05:43,000
克莉丝:对不起,我猜的不好,是吗?
Chrissy: Sorry.I'm not doing so good, am I?

85
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:48,500
本:不,还好了.你最后25个题目答对了2个.
Ben: No, that's okay.You got two out of the last, uh, 25.

86
00:05:50,640 --> 00:05:52,340
麦琪:干什么呢?你们在玩游戏吗?
Maggie: What's up?You guys playing some kind of game?

87
00:05:52,500 --> 00:05:54,820
克莉丝:本在考我是不是有月经症状.
Chrissy: Ben's testing to see if I have PMS.

88
00:05:59,200 --> 00:05:59,900
麦琪:什么?
Maggie: What?

89
00:06:02,320 --> 00:06:05,900
本:呃,是超感功能.我在做一份加分报告.这是埃尔哈德老师的科学课要求的.
Ben: Uh, ESP, mom.I'm doing an extra-credit report for Mr.Airhead's science class.

90
00:06:05,900 --> 00:06:09,400
麦琪:埃尔哈德老师,就是这一年里一直让你难受的那个老师吗?
Maggie: Mr.Airheart, the teacher who's been giving you such a hard time all year?

91
00:06:11,640 --> 00:06:13,920
本:是的.如果我不把平均分提高到B,
Ben: Yeah.And if I don't get my average up to a B,

92
00:06:14,400 --> 00:06:15,400
他就不让我到海登天文馆,参加班级的野外考察活动.
he's not going to let me go on the class field trip to the Hayden Planetarium.

93
00:06:17,820 --> 00:06:18,820
麦琪:哦,这样啊.
Maggie: Oh, well, Ben,

94
00:06:18,900 --> 00:06:21,280
本,我和你爸爸很乐意带你去天文馆.
your father and I'd be happy to take you to the planetarium.

95
00:06:21,700 --> 00:06:25,620
本:是的,不过,
Ben: Yes, but can you arrange for Sasha Sorotski to be sitting next to

96
00:06:25,620 --> 00:06:27,300
你能安排萨莎索罗特斯基在黑暗之中坐在我旁边…穿着软毛衣?
me in the dark... wearing a fuzzy sweater.

97
00:06:27,300 --> 00:06:32,000
麦琪:做梦.
Maggie: Gotcha!

98
00:06:34,140 --> 00:06:35,640
迈克:本说你们想跟我谈谈?
Mike: Ben said you guys wanted to talk to me?

99
00:06:35,980 --> 00:06:37,060
麦琪:是关于卢克的.
Maggie: It's about Luke.

100
00:06:37,340 --> 00:06:39,020
杰森:我们打算承认,我们,呃…
Jason: We're ready to admit we, uh.....

101
00:06:39,020 --> 00:06:39,120
迈克:…错了?
Mike: ...were wrong?

102
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:39,220
杰森:不.
Jason: No.

103
00:06:39,220 --> 00:06:40,500
迈克:大错特错了?
Mike: Were very, very wrong?

104
00:06:42,940 --> 00:06:46,280
麦琪:不,我们打算承认我们需要你的帮助.
Maggie: No, we're ready to admit that we need your help.

105
00:06:46,460 --> 00:06:47,960
迈克:哦,我觉得你们的决定很正确.
Mike: Well, I think you made the right decision.

106
00:06:48,340 --> 00:06:50,540
你们想抓住野马还是利用野马.
You want to catch a mustang, you gotta use a mustang.

107
00:06:51,360 --> 00:06:53,760
让我直说吧…要我跟他说什么?
So let me get this straight...what is it that you want me to tell him?

108
00:06:53,880 --> 00:06:54,640
杰森:实行宵禁!
Jason: He's grounded!

109
00:06:54,820 --> 00:06:55,900
迈克:不能这样!
Mike: No stinking way!

110
00:06:58,120 --> 00:07:00,480
杰森:如果一个孩子不能学着遵守家里的规矩,
Jason: If a kid can't learn to live by a family's rules,

111
00:07:00,540 --> 00:07:02,500
他就永远不会学着遵守社会准则.迈克,
he'll never learn to live by society's, Mike.

112
00:07:02,520 --> 00:07:04,740
你有责任教卢克遵守纪律.
Now you owe it to Luke to teach him some discipline.

113
00:07:05,720 --> 00:07:09,020
迈克:我讨厌你们讲什么大道理.好,好,我跟他谈.
Mike: I hate it when you guys make sense.Okay, okay, I'll talk to him.

114
00:07:09,100 --> 00:07:11,100
可如果他晚回来有充分的理由,
But if he's got a darn good reason for being late,

115
00:07:11,100 --> 00:07:12,460
我不会无缘无故地教训他.
I'm not giving him any punishment.

116
00:07:17,660 --> 00:07:18,460
迈克:卢克回来了.
Mike: Luke's home.

117
00:07:22,500 --> 00:07:23,300
卢克:哦,哈罗.
Luke: Uh, hello.

118
00:07:23,300 --> 00:07:24,900
迈克:嘿,卢克,现在11点15了,你知道意味着什么吗?
Mike: Hey, Luke.It's 11:15.You know what that means?

119
00:07:27,060 --> 00:07:28,240
卢克:我错过了电视剧!
Luke: I'm missing Arsenio!

120
00:07:28,420 --> 00:07:30,780
杰森:嘿·你该在10点就回家的.
Jason: Hey!You were supposed to be home by 10:00.

121
00:07:31,180 --> 00:07:33,860
迈克:可我肯定他晚回来是有特殊原因的.
Mike: But I'm sure that he's got a darn good reason for being late.

122
00:07:33,960 --> 00:07:35,120
快给他讲讲.
So, go ahead and give it to him.

123
00:07:37,140 --> 00:07:40,780
卢克:哦,我去了游戏厅.那里有一台机器,能玩10个免费游戏.
Luke: Uh, I was at the arcade.We found a video machine with ten free games.

124
00:07:43,080 --> 00:07:44,800
迈克:哦,那好吧,好吧,我没的选择了.你要…
Mike: Well, okay, okay.You give me no choice.You're....

125
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:46,300
麦琪:…被宵禁.
Maggie: ...grounded.

126
00:07:48,460 --> 00:07:48,500
迈克:她说了.
Mike: What she said.

127
00:07:48,500 --> 00:07:53,400
卢克:什么?不过,能从下周一开始吗?周五晚上有个重要的晚会.
Luke: What?But, well can it start Monday?There's a major party Friday night.

128
00:07:55,660 --> 00:07:56,460
迈克:好的,没问题.
Mike: Okay, sure.

129
00:07:57,500 --> 00:07:58,980
麦琪:迈克!你不能让在惩罚上他讨价还价.
Maggie: Mike!You can't let him trade punishments.

130
00:07:59,060 --> 00:07:59,900
这不是"让我们做笔买卖".
This isn't "Let's Make a Deal."

131
00:07:59,900 --> 00:08:02,600
迈克:可他穿的很像做买卖的.
Mike: Although he's dressed for it.

132
00:08:04,640 --> 00:08:07,080
麦琪:宵禁包括不能参加晚会.
Maggie: The grounding includes missing the party.

133
00:08:07,780 --> 00:08:09,820
卢克:我不明白你们为什么把我当孩子看.
Luke: I don't know why you're treating me like a kid.

134
00:08:09,820 --> 00:08:13,780
我要11点上床,可我有3年根本就没有床.
I gotta be in bed by 11:00.I went three years with no bed.

135
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:15,760
我晚上就在中央公园睡.
I've spent the night in Central Park.

136
00:08:16,020 --> 00:08:19,500
我碰到过匪徒,杀人犯,还看过不良青年的摇滚歌会.
I've survived gangs, murderers, and Pia Zadora's outdoor concert.

137
