00:15:46,760 --> 00:15:49,400
本:先生,我花了很大力气才搞成这个实验.
Ben: Sir, I worked very hard on setting up this experiment.

274
00:15:49,400 --> 00:15:53,920
咱俩都知道,我不是一个差劲的学生,
We both know I'm not a bad student, and I deserve a B.

275
00:15:54,460 --> 00:15:56,700
我应该得个B,我也应该去参观天文馆.
I also deserve to go on that field trip.

276
00:15:57,540 --> 00:15:59,120
埃尔哈德:啊,我答应.
Airheart: Oh, why not.

277
00:16:00,140 --> 00:16:01,100
为什么不呢?我从没见过一个学生为了去天文馆会这么用功.
Why, I've never seen a student work so hard to get to the planetarium.

278
00:16:01,100 --> 00:16:02,600
本:天文学是我的生命!
Ben: Astronomy is my life!

279
00:16:02,600 --> 00:16:07,800
埃尔哈德:萨莎·索罗特斯基也不错吧.
Airheart: Sasha Sorotski isn't so bad either.

280
00:16:11,300 --> 00:16:14,860
本:克莉丝,你真的猜出我拿的是什么吗?
Ben: Chrissy, you actually guessed what I was holding up?

281
00:16:15,320 --> 00:16:18,380
克莉丝:怎么会呢?我看起来像什么,一个算卦的?
Chrissy: Are you kidding?What do I look like, a mind-reader?

282
00:16:20,160 --> 00:16:22,800
本:哦,那么,这次和上次有什么不一样呢?
Ben: Well, then, what's the difference between this time and last time?

283
00:16:23,060 --> 00:16:25,400
克莉丝:上次,我看不到你眼镜片发射过来的东西.
Chrissy: Last time I couldn't see the reflection in your glasses.

284
00:16:29,460 --> 00:16:33,940
本:那么,那些"茶话会",我坐在特迪熊边上呢,还是你边上?
Ben: So, these tea parties; do I sit next to Mr.Teddybear, or by you?

285
00:16:34,300 --> 00:16:35,500
克莉丝:我边上.
Chrissy: By me.

286
00:16:46,680 --> 00:16:50,900
迈克:好了,好了,10点59分,他到家肯定11点整.卢克是个负责的孩子.我能按他的进门的时间对我的表.
Mike: Ok, ok.10:59, He'll be home by 11:00.Luke's a responsible kid.I can set my watch by the Luke-meister.

287
00:16:50,900 --> 00:16:53,800
电视播音员:现在是11点.你知道你们的孩子在哪里吗?
TV Announcer: It's 11:00, do you know where your children are?

288
00:17:00,200 --> 00:17:06,680
电视播音员:由于有一辆装小鸡的车翻了,
TV Announcer: Two lanes of the Long Island Expressway have been temporarily

289
00:17:06,680 --> 00:17:06,800
长岛高速路两侧的单行道暂时关闭.
closed, due to an overturned chicken truck.Guess you'd better steer clear.

290
00:17:06,800 --> 00:17:09,500
您最好改道行驶并注意交通安全.
Offering biscuits and gravy.

291
00:17:13,300 --> 00:17:15,880
迈克:小鸡!我讨厌碰到这种事.
Mike: Chickens!I'd hate to be caught in that mess.

292
00:17:21,600 --> 00:17:22,600
迈克:严重吗?
Mike: How bad is it?

293
00:17:22,600 --> 00:17:23,700
护士:代号F!代号F!
Nurse: Code F!Code F!

294
00:17:23,700 --> 00:17:25,000
迈克:哦,这是什么意思啊?
Mike: Well, what does that mean?

295
00:17:25,000 --> 00:17:30,900
医生:我必须做羽毛切除手术.还有希望,他是个勇敢的小小伙子.护士!
Doctor: I'll have to do a feather-ectomy.There's hope, he's a plucky little guy.Nurse!

296
00:17:56,840 --> 00:17:57,520
护士:是,医生.
Nurse: Yes, doctor.

297
00:17:57,520 --> 00:17:57,620
医生:钳子.
Doctor: Tweezers

298
00:17:57,620 --> 00:17:57,720
护士:钳子.
Nurse: Tweezers.

299
00:17:57,720 --> 00:17:57,820
迈克:卢克,卢克!能听见我吗?你怎么样?
Mike: Luke, Luke!Can you hear me?Are you all right?

300
00:17:57,820 --> 00:17:57,920
卢克:(虚弱地)是你吗,迈克?
Luke: (spitting) Is that you, Mike?

301
00:17:57,920 --> 00:17:58,020
迈克:是我,是我.我就在这里.
Mike: Yeah, yeah, it's me.I'm right here.

302
00:17:58,020 --> 00:17:58,120
卢克:你为什么不阻止我去参加晚会呢?
Luke: Why didn't you stop me from going to the party?

303
00:17:58,120 --> 00:17:58,220
医生:对不起,西沃先生,但只有一件事我们可以做了.
Doctor: I'm sorry, Mr.Seaver, but there's only one more thing I can do.

304
00:17:58,220 --> 00:17:58,320
迈克:是什么?
Mike: What is it?

305
00:17:58,320 --> 00:17:58,420
医生:我要叫一个专家.护士!
Doctor: I'll have to call in a specialist.Nurse!

306
00:17:58,420 --> 00:17:58,520
护士:是,医生.
Nurse: Yes, doctor.

307
00:17:58,520 --> 00:17:59,280
医生:给桑德罗上校打电话.
Doctor: Get Colonel Sanders on the phone.

308
00:18:00,240 --> 00:18:01,800
护士:桑德罗上校死了,先生.
Nurse: Colonel Sanders is dead, sir.

309
00:18:03,540 --> 00:18:05,120
医生:噢-哦!
Doctor: Oh-oh!

310
00:18:05,120 --> 00:18:07,800
迈克:哦,天啊,
Mike: Oh come on, what kind of trouble could he possibly get into?

311
00:18:09,100 --> 00:18:11,200
他也许会卷到什么麻烦事儿里去呢?我是说他不会胡来的.
I mean, it's not like he's wild.

312
00:18:11,800 --> 00:18:16,000
台球玩家:天不早了,布鲁沃尔,你是不该回家了?
Pool Player: It's kinda late, Brower, shouldn't you be getting home?

313
00:18:19,400 --> 00:18:21,500
卢克:(笑)我的监护人是个十足的笨蛋,他被我训练地像只长耳朵狗.
Luke: (laughing) My guardian's the perfect sap!I've got him trained like a cocker spaniel

314
00:18:21,500 --> 00:18:23,500
台球玩家:(笑)有只宠物真不错.
Pool Player: (laughing) It's nice to have a pet.

315
00:18:27,240 --> 00:18:32,400
卢克:嘿,服务生!给每个人来一杯鲜啤酒!把瓶子放这.
Luke: Hey, bartender!Another round of root-beer floats!And leave the bottle!

316
00:18:32,800 --> 00:18:42,200
迈克:我懂了!咳,妈妈是对的!11点以后还不知发生什么事儿呢.他会撒野;
Mike: I knew it!Gosh, mom was right!There's no telling what could happen after 11:00.He could run wild.

317
00:18:45,860 --> 00:18:48,720
他会犯法;他会走上犯罪的道路.
He could break the law.He could take up a life of crime.

318
00:18:57,320 --> 00:18:59,300
牧师:我的孩子,你还有什么要最后忏悔?
Priest: My son, do you have any last confessions?

319
00:18:59,300 --> 00:18:59,500
卢克:我喜欢过交际花.
Luke: I liked Ishtar.

320
00:19:03,100 --> 00:19:07,220
牧师:那会毁了你的.有什么人想让我联系吗?
Priest: That'll cost you.Is there anyone you'd like me to contact?

321
00:19:08,740 --> 00:19:09,600
卢克:叫迈克西沃.就因为他,
Luke: Call Mike Seaver.

322
00:19:10,640 --> 00:19:15,880
我才变野了,破坏宵禁,
Thanks to him, I ran wild, broke curfew, and took up a life of crime.

323
00:19:17,420 --> 00:19:18,860
后来又开始犯罪.怎么突然出现回声了?
How come suddenly there's an echo?

324
00:19:19,120 --> 00:19:23,280
牧师:我们只是用在关键词上.好了,
Priest: We only use it on the important words.Well, the chair is waiting.

325
00:19:24,100 --> 00:19:24,560
他们都在等着呢.我们去吧.对不起.
Let's get cookin'.Sorry.

326
00:19:24,900 --> 00:19:28,000
迈克:他喜欢过交际花?
Mike: He liked Ishtar?

327
00:19:31,460 --> 00:19:34,020
迈克:卢克,卢克!你知道现在几点了吗?
Mike: Luke, Luke!Do you have any idea what time it is?

328
00:19:34,200 --> 00:19:36,080
卢克:嘿,我是破坏了宵禁,
Luke: Hey, I guess I blew it with that curfew thing,

329
00:19:36,080 --> 00:19:37,420
但至少我打败了你的父母.
but at least I beat your parent home.

330
00:19:37,480 --> 00:19:39,560
迈克:嘿,先别说我的父母,你先回答我.
Mike: Hey, forget about my parents.You've got to answer to me.

331
00:19:39,560 --> 00:19:40,700
卢克:迈克!迈克--!迈克王子!
Luke: Mike!Mike-ee!Mike-a-maniac!

332
00:19:40,700 --> 00:19:44,400
迈克:嘿,别叫我迈克王子!你被"停飞"了.
Mike: Hey, don't you Mike-a-maniac me!You're grounded.

333
00:19:44,400 --> 00:19:44,800
卢克:什么?
Luke: What?

334
00:19:48,440 --> 00:19:49,120
迈克:一个月.
Mike: For one month.

335
00:19:49,560 --> 00:19:50,060
卢克:开玩笑!
Luke: You're kidding!

336
00:19:50,160 --> 00:19:50,940
迈克:不,
Mike: No, I'm not kidding.

337
00:19:50,960 --> 00:19:52,820
我没有.你知道你今晚让我多担心吗?
Do you have any idea what you put me through tonight?

338
00:19:53,620 --> 00:19:55,680
我是说我幻想着你死了!
I mean, I'm imagining that you're dead.

339
00:19:55,920 --> 00:19:57,260
担心能不能再见你.
Wondering if I'm ever gonna see you again.

340
00:19:57,520 --> 00:20:00,760
卢克:嘿,我做的事情,你都做了无数遍了.
Luke: Hey, I didn't do anything you haven't done a million times.

341
00:20:00,820 --> 00:20:01,880
迈克:哦,可那不一样,卢克.
Mike: Well, that was different, Luke.

342
00:20:01,900 --> 00:20:04,100
我那样做不是为自己,是给父母看的.
I didn't do it to me; I did it to my parents.

343
00:20:06,420 --> 00:20:11,740
现在我知道他们的感受;他们只是想保护我.哦,哇噢,
Now I know how they felt; they were just protecting me.Oh, whoa!

344
00:20:12,980 --> 00:20:14,600
听我说!如果下次我再纵容你,
Listen to me!Next thing you know,

345
00:20:14,620 --> 00:20:17,420
我就买双白鞋绑在自己的胸脯上.
I'll be wearing white shoes and my belt up around my nipples.

346
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:23,820
杰森:就这样,卢克,你被"停飞"了,这次我是下定决心了.
Jason: That's it, Luke.You're grounded, and this time we mean business.

347
00:20:24,160 --> 00:20:24,840
麦琪:两周.
Maggie: Two weeks.

348
00:20:25,120 --> 00:20:26,760
迈克:嘿,嘿,我已经"停飞"他一个月了.
Mike: Hey, hey, I grounded him for a month.

349
00:20:26,900 --> 00:20:28,400
杰森:一个月?有点重了吧?
Jason: A month?Isn't that a little severe?

350
00:20:28,660 --> 00:20:30,860
迈克:爸爸,别这样.不要在孩--子的面前破坏我的威信.
Mike: Dad, please.Do not undermine me in front of the K-I-D.

351
00:20:32,860 --> 00:20:34,960
现在听着,先生,我要你回到自己的房间,
Now listen, mister, I want you to march up to your room,

352
00:20:34,960 --> 00:20:36,800
好好想想你都干了些什么.我是认真的,还有收起你脸上的那种表情.
and think about what you've done.I'm serious.And wipe that look off your face.

353
00:20:36,800 --> 00:20:42,200
卢克:哎吆!
Luke: Phew!

354
00:20:45,760 --> 00:20:49,680
麦琪:迈克,你想重新考虑一下吗?你对他太严厉了.
Maggie: Mike, don't you want to reconsider?You were a little rough on him.

355
00:20:49,860 --> 00:20:51,560
迈克:等你有了孩子,你就会明白了.
Mike: You'll understand when you have kids.

356
00:21:00,460 --> 00:21:01,500
麦琪:嘘!别告诉迈克,我给你多拿了一些甜点.
Maggie: Shh!Don't tell Mike, but I brought you up a little extra dessert.

357
00:21:01,500 --> 00:21:02,600
卢克:谢谢!
Luke: Thanks!

358
00:21:06,040 --> 00:21:06,200
麦琪:我正在劝他,让他给你改过自新的机会.
Maggie: I'm still working on him to give you time off for good behavior.

359
00:21:06,200 --> 00:21:11,300
卢克:谢谢!
Luke: Thanks!

360
00:21:14,780 --> 00:21:17,580
杰森:嗨,卢克,迈克呢?
Jason: Hi, Luke.Where's Mike?

361
00:21:17,580 --> 00:21:17,680
卢克:哦,我没见着他.
Luke: Uh, I haven't seen him.

362
00:21:19,640 --> 00:21:21,700
杰森:好.这样,哦,我知道他不准你看电视,不过…
Jason: Good.So, uh, I know he said no more TV, but...

363
00:21:21,700 --> 00:21:22,500
卢克:电视!
Luke: TV!

364
00:21:26,200 --> 00:21:30,980
杰森:嘘!藏起来,藏起来.我没来过.
Jason: Shh!Just put it away.Put it away.I was never here.

365
00:21:49,540 --> 00:21:51,120
卢克:好啊,你在监视我.
Luke: Great, you're spying on me.

366
00:21:51,900 --> 00:21:54,960
迈克:卢克,"停飞"了这么久,你该吸取教训了吧.
Mike: Luke, it's time you learned something from being grounded.

367
00:21:55,640 --> 00:21:58,360
卢克:天啊,你太狠了.什么,你要给窗户上栏杆吗?
Luke: Boy, you don't let up.What, are you measuring the window for bars?

368
00:21:59,480 --> 00:22:02,500
迈克:不!是你学习如何逃跑的时候了.快点.
Mike: No!It's time you learned how to sneak out.Come on!

369
00:22:02,500 --> 00:22:04,800
卢克:但这是你的惩罚.
Luke: But this is your punishment.

370
00:22:05,240 --> 00:22:09,630
迈克:我知道.如果你说出去,你就被"停飞".冲啊!
卢克:迈克!
00:22:14,200
Mike: I know.And if you say anything, you're grounded.Let's go! Luke: Mike!
